---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Cookie policy — TurnKey">
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-[var(--color-orange)] uppercase mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-10">Cookie policy</h1>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--color-anthracite)]/80 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">What is a cookie?</h2>
          <p>A cookie is a small text file placed on your device when you visit a website. It allows the site to remember your preferences, measure audience or ease navigation.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Cookies used on turnkey.pt</h2>
          <p>The site <strong>turnkey.pt</strong> is deliberately minimalist regarding trackers. We use <strong>no advertising cookies and no third-party tracking</strong> (no Google Analytics, no Facebook Pixel, nothing equivalent).</p>
          <p class="mt-3">The only cookies that may be set are:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Cloudflare technical cookies</strong> (hosting): protect the site against attacks and ensure availability. Duration: session or up to 30 days.</li>
            <li><strong>Formspree technical cookies</strong> (only if you submit a form): required for anti-spam protection. Duration: session.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">These cookies are considered <strong>strictly necessary</strong> for the site to function and do not require prior consent.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Manage your cookies</h2>
          <p>You can delete or block cookies at any time through your browser settings:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">Chrome</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/kb/activer-desactiver-cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">Firefox</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/sfri11471" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">Safari</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">Edge</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">Blocking these technical cookies may cause partial site malfunction.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-anthracite)] mb-3">Evolution</h2>
          <p>If we add audience measurement tools in the future (such as Plausible or Fathom) or any other tracker, this page will be updated and a consent banner will be displayed on your next visit.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-anthracite)]/50">Last update: October 2026</p>
          <p class="mt-4"><a href="/en/" class="text-[var(--color-orange)] hover:underline">← Back to home</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
